ion#System properties#{2}":[43,43],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#System properties#{3}":[44,44],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#System properties#{4}":[45,45],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#System properties#{5}":[46,46],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#System properties#{6}":[47,47],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#System properties#{7}":[48,49],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload":[50,88],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{1}":[52,52],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{2}":[53,53],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{3}":[54,55],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{4}":[56,57],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{5}":[58,61],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{6}":[62,67],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{7}":[68,68],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{8}":[69,69],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{9}":[70,71],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{10}":[72,84],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{11}":[85,85],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{12}":[86,86],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Resolution#Payload flags and adjusting payload#{13}":[87,88],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Related Links":[89,94],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Related Links#{1}":[91,91],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Related Links#{2}":[92,92],"##How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery#Related Links#{3}":[93,94]},"outlinks":[{"title":"{className: \"cmdb\\_ci\\_server\", classUpgrade: true, classDowngrade: true, classSwitch: true, values: {name: \"linux123\", serial\\_number: \"12srt567\"...\n\n-   updateWithoutUpgrade\n-   updateWithoutDowngrade\n-   updateWithoutSwitch\n\n**Note:** These settings work in conjunction with the related system properties. If _either_ the payload flag or the system property is **true**, the system updates the CI without changing its class. \n\nAdd the following flags under the items.settings object to explicitly control update behavior without class change:\n\n{ items: \\[{className: 'cmdb\\_ci\\_server',values: {name: 'linux123'},\"settings\": {\"skipReclassificationRestrictionRules\" : \"true\", \"updateWithoutSwitch\": \"false\"}...\n\n  \n**Important notes**\n\nUpdating the payload before it is sent to the IRE is specific to the application which is passing data to the IRE.\n\nModifications can be applied via:\n\n-   Transform scripts (for data imports)\n-   Pre/post-processing scripts (for Discovery)\n-   Custom integrations\n\n### Related Links\n\n-   [Reclassify a CI","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/csh?topicname=t_ManuallyReclassifyCI.html&version=latest \"Reclassify a CI\"","line":66},{"title":"Configure CI reclassification during IRE processing","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/csh?topicname=c_CIReclassification.html&version=latest","line":92},{"title":"Properties for Identification and Reconciliation","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/csh?topicname=properties-id-reconciliation.html&version=latest \"Properties for Identification and Reconciliation\"","line":93}],"metadata":{"title":"How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery","aliases":["KB0812249"],"tags":["#servicenow","#support-kb"],"source_url":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0812249","kb_number":"KB0812249","last_modified":"2026-04-01"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/discovery/KB0812249 - How to resolve CI reclassification errors during discovery.md"},
